			236
		</span></i>: (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λικριφίς</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>slanting, crosswise</i>, with a Verb, 
